<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 846 725" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
<title id="title">Zane Wang — building tools that make AI coding agents more reliable</title>
<desc id="desc">A pixel-art sunset over a city drawn from the past year of Zane's GitHub contributions: one building per week, one window per day, lit on the {{ACTIVE_DAYS}} days he contributed, and a gold pennant over each week in which one of his pull requests was merged upstream. Below the city: 12 PRs merged into 10 upstream projects between {{MERGED_RANGE}}, namely axum, SQLx, AnyIO, goose, Fastify, Zod, TanStack Query, Tenacity, Feast and Claude HUD (three), 10 bug fixes and 2 small features, each merged by that project's maintainers. His production background covers multimodal evaluation and data systems; his current public focus is tools for reliable AI coding agents: claudemem, handoff and dev-orchestrator.</desc>
